 the SAP DRC and e-invoicing activities.</p><p>We are looking for a strong delivery professional with a solid SAP technical background and hands-on experience in <strong>SAP Document and Reporting Compliance (DRC) and e-invoicing implementations</strong>. The focus of the role is not primarily on configuration, but on coordinating the different teams, managing dependencies and driving the workstream toward successful delivery.</p><p>Project Conditions:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Start:</strong> Mid-November / beginning of December 2026</p></li><li><p><strong>Contract</strong>: Freelance</p></li><li><p><strong>Duration:</strong> Expected until mid-October 2027</p></li><li><p><strong>Workload:</strong> 0.5–1.0 FTE, most likely ramping up toward full-time</p></li><li><p><strong>Location:</strong> Budapest</p></li><li><p><strong>Working model:</strong> Remote (Hungary)</p></li><li><p><strong>Language:</strong> Fluent English </p></li></ul><h2>Tasks</h2><ul><li><p>Coordinate the SAP DRC / e-invoicing workstream across multiple Business and IT teams.</p></li><li><p>Drive alignment between Finance, Tax, SD, MM, Procure-to-Pay / purchasing and payment processes and the relevant technical teams.</p></li><li><p>Manage cross-functional dependencies, priorities, risks and open topics across the e-invoicing activities.</p></li><li><p>Facilitate collaboration between business stakeholders, functional SAP teams and technical IT teams.</p></li><li><p>Support planning, coordination and execution of the e-invoicing implementation within the broader S/4HANA transformation.</p></li><li><p>Ensure transparency around progress, dependencies, decisions and potential delivery risks.</p></li><li><p>Facilitate meetings, workshops and working sessions across distributed international teams.</p></li><li><p>Support backlog, action and delivery tracking and ensure that agreed next steps are followed through.</p></li><li><p>Act as a central coordination point for the different teams involved in the e-invoicing solution.</p></li><li><p>Work closely with the respective workstream and program/workstream leadership to ensure alignment with the overall transformation roadmap.</p></li></ul><h2>Requirements</h2><ul><li><p>Strong experience in project delivery, workstream coordination or Scrum Master responsibilities within complex SAP or IT transformation programs.</p></li><li><p>Experience coordinating multiple Business and IT teams in an international environment.</p></li><li><p>Strong SAP background and a good understanding of complex SAP landscapes and cross-functional dependencies.</p></li><li><p>Experience with SAP DRC / Document and Reporting Compliance.</p></li><li><p>Experience with e-invoicing implementations, ideally having already supported or led the implementation of an SAP DRC e-invoicing solution or related workstream.</p></li><li><p>Good cross-functional understanding across SAP SD, FI/Finance, MM and Tax.</p></li><li><p>Understanding of Procure-to-Pay processes and their interaction with Finance, Tax and e-invoicing.</p></li><li><p>Strong delivery and leadership capabilities gained in roles such as Scrum Master, Project Manager, Workstream Lead, Product Owner or Solution Lead.</p></li><li><p>Ability to understand both business requirements and technical dependencies and translate between different stakeholder groups.</p></li><li><p>Strong organizational, facilitation and communication skills.</p></li><li><p>Proactive, structured and hands-on working style.</p></li><li><p>Experience working with distributed international teams.</p></li><li><p>Fluent English is mandatory.</p></li><li><p>Previous experience within the client's organization or transformation program would be a strong advantage.</p></li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/sidekick-network-gmbh-co-kg/sap-drc-e-invoicing-delivery-lead-scrum-master-freelance-bonn-467175","tags":["Re