&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We understand that many legal professionals have chosen to adopt the consultancy model, and we are happy to discuss this option with you. We offer both consultants and employees the opportunity to work with our enviable client roster. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.axiomlaw.com/contact-us&quot;&gt;Contact us&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;in complete confidence to find out more about opportunities to work with Axiom as an employee or consultant.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
