 and oversee multidisciplinary delivery teams to ensure cutting-edge AI deployments are secure, reliable, and grounded in real-world impact.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br />You will also act as a strategic entrepreneur, building our market presence and bridging the gap between cutting-edge AI and mission-critical needs. By blending deep domain expertise with delivery leadership,  you will secure high-stakes partnerships and oversee multidisciplinary teams to ensure our technology delivers transformational capability for UK and Allied Defence.<br /></p><h2><strong>What you'll be doing:</strong><br /></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Leading strategic accounts across UK MOD and Industry to build long-term partnerships focused on strategic advantage through cutting edge AI.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Cultivating deep, strategic relationships with senior stakeholders to unlock long-term partnership opportunities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Designing transformation programmes in collaboration with technical experts that integrate advanced AI into mission-critical capabilities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Overseeing delivery excellence across cross-functional teams of engineers, researchers, and delivery leads to ensure high-stakes projects succeed.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Developing commercial strategies and proposals that expand our work across Aerospace and Space both in the UK and internationally to meet ambitious growth goals.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Mentoring and coaching a growing team of commercial and delivery professionals, fostering their development in a fast-paced, high-growth environment.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>Who we're looking for:</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You bring deep expertise in Aerospace, Defence or