&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/netcraft/emea-new-business-account-executive-manchester-bath-326313","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":[],"location":"Manchester, Bath)","created_at":1791626105},{"slug":"staff-machine-learning-engineer-london-74394","company_name":"Almedia","title":"Staff Machine Learning Engineer","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em">This isn’t your regular job. Almedia is a place where those who want to push harder can accelerate their careers faster than anywhere else. We’re aiming to become Germany’s second bootstrapped unicorn. Almedia is already Europe’s #3 fastest-growing company in 2025 (FT1000).</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are building the future of marketing by rewarding our community of over 95 million users for engaging with our advertisers’ products. We are offering a new way to acquire users for the biggest companies in the world.<br /></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Staff Machine Learning Engineer</strong><br />London, King's Cross<br />Top-of-market compensation</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The Role</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll take ownership of designing, building, and shipping production-grade systems that power ranking, personalisation, and reward structures in real time. You work hands-on with a small, high-ownership team. You have real influence over how we build our infrastructure as we grow it together.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You spot leverage points others miss: systems that shift behaviour, ranking that balances user value and business sustainability, measurement frameworks that prove what actually works. You own these end to end.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What You'll Own</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ranking and personalisation systems that reach the right users in real time</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Reward and payout infrastructure balancing user motivation, cost, and business value</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Behavioural prediction through time-series and sequence systems</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Measurement and validation using A/B testing, causal inference, uplift modelling</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">ML infrastructure: pipelines, training loops, serving, monitoring</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Technical leadership and mentorship on shipping discipline and impact</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What We're Looking For</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Shipped production systems end to end, from formulation through impact measurement</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Full-stack capability: data pipeline to live serving to monitoring and decay</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Causal thinking: propensity scoring, instrumental variables, contextual bandits, uplift modelling</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Scale experience: built systems handling high-volume behavioural datasets and real-time inference</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Published work or equivalent research discipline</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Builder's mindset: energised by shipping. Zero-to-one experience valued</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Cross-functional: collaborate across engineering, product, and data science teams on measurement and infrastructure</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why This Matters</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Real behavioural sequences. Billions of user decisions across multiple games. Your systems handle cold start, sparse reward, imbalanced value distributions. Both measurement rigour and systems thinking matter here.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why Almedia</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Profitable from launch. Higher revenue per employee than Big Tech.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Small team by design. Every hire raises the bar.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Top-of-market compensation including substantial equity.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Real behavioural data at scale. Billions of user interactions, millions of daily active users.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We believe in fostering talent, evaluating all skill levels during the hiring process, and providing a clear path for growth. Almedia is an equal opportunity employer. We embrace and celebrate diversity, and encourage individuals from all backgrounds to apply.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/almedia/staff-machine-learning-engineer-london-74394","tags":["Tech"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1791625210},{"slug":"revenue-operations-manager-uk-169843","company_name":"DeepJudge","title":"Revenue Operations Manager","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About us:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Founded by former Google search engineers with PhDs in AI from ETH Zurich, DeepJudge helps legal teams unlock and apply the knowledge inside their organizations through world-class enterprise search and AI infrastructure – enabling them to automate workflows, build knowledge-powered applications, and turn institutional knowledge into a lasting advantage.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Every organization can license the same AI models, but no two organizations share the same institutional knowledge. Decades of experience, work product, and precedent are often fragmented across systems, underused, and inaccessible. DeepJudge makes this expertise instantly available and actionable – helping legal teams find the right information faster, surface relevant knowledge, and apply it where it matters most.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our platform is trusted by many of the world’s leading law firms and legal teams, including Holland &amp; Knight, Gunderson Dettmer, Cozen O’Connor, ArentFox Schiff, CMS Switzerland, Schoenherr, and others.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Headquartered in Switzerland with a growing team across North America and Europe, DeepJudge is shaping the future of how professional knowledge is discovered and applied.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At DeepJudge, we move with urgency, think rigorously, and work closely with our clients to build products that solve meaningful problems. If you want to help define how AI transforms professional knowledge work, we’d love to hear from you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About the role:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re looking for a Revenue Operations Manager to strengthen the systems that power our go-to-market teams.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a builder role for someone who can design, implement, and own the processes, workflows, automations, and data architecture that accelerate how we find, engage, win, onboard, retain, and expand customers at scale. You will partner across Marketing, Sales, Customer Success, and Partnership to turn fragmented systems and manual work into a high-leverage GTM engine.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you naturally think: “This should be an automated system, not a spreadsheet.” …you’ll likely be a strong fit. We would love to connect with you about enabling our rapidly growing revenue team. You will play a key role in increasing internal efficiency and productivity to support the team in creating the best customer experience, and in driving commercial success.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your responsibilities will include:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">CRM and revenue tech stack architecture</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own end-to-end <strong>CRM administration</strong> as the single source of truth for revenue activities</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage the design, configuration, and roadmap of a connected <strong>revenue tech stack</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set and enforce <strong>data governance</strong> standards: field hygiene, deduplication, permissions, and ongoing data-quality monitoring</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Automation and data foundation</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Automate</strong> and enrich the manual layer with workflows and LLMs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and maintain operational <strong>dashboards</strong> (recurring KPIs, data hygiene, system adoption)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Advise with thought leadership on which tooling we procure next as we scale</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Cross-functional partnership and enablement</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Operational <strong>business partner</strong> to GTM leadership</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive <strong>systems and process adoption</strong> across Marketing, Sales, Customer Success, and Partnership teams through training and enablement</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Act as first point of contact for revenue system support tickets</p></li></ul></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What success looks like in 12 months:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">GTM signals are consistently translated into actionable workflows</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sellers and customer-facing teams spend materially less time on manual admin and prep</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Critical revenue systems are connected, key workflows are AI-assisted or fully automated</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Leadership has a real-time view into pipeline, conversion, execution, and customer health</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You're a great fit if you:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">5+ years in Revenue/Sales Operations in a B2B SaaS hypergrowth environment</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deep hands-on expertise in CRM administration (HubSpot/Salesforce)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven track record building revenue systems, processes, and data flows from scratch</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Persistent problem-solver at your core</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sharp entrepreneurial instincts and analytical mindset</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent cross-functional stakeholder management</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you can look forward to:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Taking full ownership of high-leverage systems and delivering work that directly impacts pipeline, productivity, and revenue</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Helping shape how a category-defining AI company builds and scales its go-to-market engine from the ground up</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A competitive compensation and equity package that reflects the leverage and strategic importance of the role</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At DeepJudge, we believe great teams are built on diverse perspectives and experiences. We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer and are committed to fostering an inclusive, high-performance culture where everyone can thrive. We welcome applicants of all backgrounds and do not discriminate based on race, religion, color, national origin, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, marital status, disability, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">If this role excites you, but you feel you don’t meet every qualification, we encourage you to apply anyway and tell us why you’d be a great fit.</p><p></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/deepjudge/revenue-operations-manager-uk-169843","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"UK","created_at":1791625205},{"slug":"remote-enterprise-account-executive-ii-dach-46034","company_name":"Camunda","title":"Enterprise Account Executive II - DACH","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em">Camunda is <strong>the enterprise platform for agentic orchestration</strong>, enabling organizations to coordinate <strong>AI agents, people, and systems </strong>across complex, end-to-end business processes. With built-in governance, auditability, and human oversight, Camunda gives enterprises the control they need to move AI from pilots to production — safely and at scale. <strong>Trusted by over 700 organizations worldwide</strong>, including 9 of top 10 US banks, Camunda helps enterprises boost operational efficiency, accelerate time-to-value, and deliver better customer experiences.<br /><br /><strong>Fully remote and global,</strong> we are in the middle of something bigger: <strong>transforming into an AI-first organisation, built on our own platform</strong>. We use Agentic AI to automate, orchestrate intelligent processes, and elevate human contribution across every team.<br /><br />Named <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.gpbullhound.com/articles/top-100-next-unicorns-the-uk-france-and-germany-lead-with-the-most-promising-technology-companies-in-europe/"><u>GP Bullhound’s Top 100 Next Unicorn list,</u></a> <strong>2025 Great Place to Work certified.</strong> <em><strong>Visionary</strong></em><strong> </strong>in <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://page.camunda.com/wp-2025-gartner-magic-quadrant-for-boat"><strong><u>2025 Gartner® Magic Quadrant™</u></strong></a><strong> </strong>for Business Orchestration and Automation Technologies. ranked <strong>3rd in Flexa's 2026 </strong><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://flexa.careers/companies/camunda"><strong>Most Flexible Companies</strong></a>, We’re growing fast and looking for top talent to join our team. <strong>If you want meaningful work, visible impact and put something genuinely rare on your CV, keep reading.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About the Role:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hi there! We're hiring a Public Sector Enterprise Account Executive II to join our Sales team.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our sales team is tenured, technically curious, and genuinely invested in doing right by the customer. We partner closely across the business, and we operate with a lot of trust: you're given real ownership over your territory, and you're expected to bring your own judgment to how you build it.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As an Enterprise Account Executive II, you'll own the full sales cycle for a defined set of Public Sector enterprise accounts, from first conversation through negotiation and close, partnering with sales engineering, customer success, and your manager to navigate complex deals. This role matters because enterprise wins are how Camunda grows its footprint in large accounts, and how we prove the platform works at scale.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role gives you a book of enterprise accounts to grow and a real say in how you build your territory. You'll work complex deals with multiple stakeholders, and you'll have the support of sales engineering and customer success behind you as you build credibility and close. Camunda’s capabilities are well-aligned to the use cases that will help the DACH Administration digitize and automate for more efficiency and agility - this is an opportunity to shape and build a large and meaningful business!</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What You Will Do</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build a territory plan that identifies Land opportunities and Expand possibilities, leveraging your extended resources such as Partners, Marketing, Inside Sales, Customer Success.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build account plans that identify whitespace, map stakeholders, and set a realistic path to close.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Navigate multi-stakeholder buying committees, including technical, business, and economic buyers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own and execute the full sales cycle, from prospecting through negotiation and close.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with sales engineering and customer success to build technical credibility and ensure a smooth handoff and adoption after close.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Represent Camunda's value to business and technical buyers, tailoring the message to what each audience actually cares about.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Handle tender processes with precision, observe pipeline health with discipline, manage Forecast with accuracy.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What You Will Bring to the Role</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Solid experience closing enterprise software deals end-to-end in DACH, with a track record across multiple full sales cycles. You know what it takes to move a deal from first meeting to signature without losing momentum.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Efficient balance between driving towards a customer vision and achieving short-term projects towards this horizon.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to work in a fast-paced environment with own initiative. The playbook will not provide all answers in advance!</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfort navigating multi-stakeholder enterprise environments. You've worked complex deals involving IT, business, and procurement stakeholders, and you know how to keep everyone moving in the same direction.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Developing territory and account planning instincts, orchestrating resources efficiently. You can build a plan with some independence, not just work from a list handed to you, and you're learning to prioritize where your time actually pays off.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience navigating complex public procurement procedures - knowing and following the processes but also influencing them with initiative and creativity.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfort selling technical products. Experience with process automation, integration platforms, middleware, or similar technical software is a real advantage here, particularly in a Public Sector context, since you'll regularly be in the room with engineering and IT buyers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Negotiation experience under real pressure. You know where to hold firm and where to flex, and you can explain your reasoning either way.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A relationship-building style that goes beyond the transaction. You've had customers start to treat you as an advisor, not just a vendor.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>This role is an existing vacancy</strong></em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">#LI-AG1 #LI-Remote #DACH</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What We Have to Offer:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Compensation</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We offer competitive, fair, and transparent compensation. Salary ranges are location-based, with Standard and Major markets (global tech hubs) reflecting local competition.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The Annual Total Target Cash </strong>(base salary + 100% variable target, where applicable) shown below spans from the minimum in a Standard market to the maximum in a Major market. Final offers depend on <strong>skills</strong>, <strong>experience</strong>, and <strong>location</strong>, and we typically hire in the first half of the range to allow room for growth:</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">United States: $244,600.00 to $394,400.00 <br />United Kingdom: £153,600.00 to £252,600.00 <br />Singapore: S$303,800.00 to S$455,700.00<br />Germany: €158,000.00 to  €261,400.00</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you’re based elsewhere, you’ll be hired via <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Remote.com"><strong><u>Remote.com</u></strong></a> (our global employer partner), and your Talent Acquisition Partner will provide a personalized <strong>Total Rewards Calculator</strong> after your first interview.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Equity: </strong>We also offer equity (where applicable) through our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hoyQAPTZ5nV7J47D9n3yqK5hhLj160Xf36iyqEXNOWE/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.2qon7r4kdfe1"><strong><u>Virtual Stock Option Plan (VSOP)</u></strong></a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Benefits &amp; Perks</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We invest in your wellbeing, growth, and ability to connect, along with perks that supp