&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;En tant que Quality Engineer (f/m/d), tu seras le/la garant·e de la qualité des produits que nous mettons à disposition de nos utilisateurs. Tes missions principales seront :&lt;br&gt;* Accompagner les équipes de développement dans la mise en place et le maintien de l&#39;automatisation des tests.&lt;br&gt;* Proposer et ajouter de nouvelles méthodes de test pour toujours garantir un plus haut niveau de qualité tout en réduisant les temps de delivery.&lt;br&gt;* Diffuser la culture de la qualité au sein de l&#39;équipe et collaborer étroitement avec les développeurs dès la phase de conception.&lt;br&gt;* Suivre les indicateurs de qualité et assurer la fiabilité globale de nos parcours utilisateurs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;* Tu as une expérience solide et confirmée en test d&#39;applications Web et de micro-services.&lt;br&gt;* Tu maîtrises l&#39;usage de l&#39;Intelligence Artificielle (IA) appliquée au métier de la QA pour optimiser et innover dans tes méthodes de test.&lt;br&gt;* Tu es reconnu·e pour ton esprit de synthèse, ta rigueur et ta capacité à évangéliser les bonnes pratiques de qualité.&lt;br&gt;* Tu sais t&#39;intégrer et collaborer efficacement dans un environnement agile.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;* Automatisation et tests : Playwright, JEST, Karate&lt;br&gt;* Suivi et gestion : JIRA&lt;br&gt;* Intégration continue (CI) : GitHub Actions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;* Organisation de travail hybride ;&lt;br&gt;* Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac ou Windows) ;&lt;br&gt;* Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;br&gt;* Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;br&gt;* Package de rémunération (actionnariat salarié, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTRE ENGAGEMENT EN FAVEUR DE L&#39;INCLUSION ET DE L&#39;ACCESSIBILITE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous reconnaissons l&#39;immense valeur qu&#39;apporte la diversité à nos équipes et nous nous efforçons continuellement de favoriser et de cultiver un lieu de travail inclusif et équitable : c&#39;est pourquoi l&#39;Inclusion est l&#39;un de nos Fondamentaux Humains. Nous encourageons les personnes de tous horizons et de toutes capacités à postuler, car nous sommes convaincu·es que la diversité des pensées, des cultures, des identités et des expériences vécues nous rend plus fort·es.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Decathlon s&#39;engage également à offrir un processus de sélection inclusif et accessible à tous les candidat·es. En cas de besoin d&#39;aménagement, tu peux en faire la demande via le formulaire de candidature, celle-ci sera confidentielle. Ces demandes n&#39;affectent pas le résultat du processus de recrutement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/junior-data-scientist-downstream-demand-forecast-value-chain/quality-engineer-paris-paris-villeneuve-dascq-nord-446271","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris, Paris; Villeneuve-d'Ascq, Nord","created_at":1791651306},{"slug":"product-manager-ecommerce-categories-paris-paris-74966","company_name":"Junior Data Scientist - Downstream Demand Forecast - Value Chain ...","title":"Product Manager - Ecommerce Categories (f/m/d)","description":"&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager - Categories (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Paris, France&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain:&lt;/strong&gt; E-Commerce Solutions — Navigate &amp;amp; Categories&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT DECATHLON &amp;amp; THE E-COMMERCE DOMAIN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon is accelerating its digital transformation with the mission of becoming &lt;strong&gt;the sports digital platform&lt;/strong&gt; that allows customers to discover our universe through local, sport-centered, and omnichannel experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission:&lt;/strong&gt; Bring people together through sport to make wellbeing accessible for all.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining this scope, you will work within the &lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce Solutions&lt;/strong&gt; domain. Our teams build and transform the global e-commerce navigation, catalog treeviews, and backend categorization engines aiming to allows users to effortlessly discover and access Decathlon’s complete offering of products, services, and information&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOIN THE CATEGORIES SQUAD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the &lt;strong&gt;Group Product Manager (E-Commerce / Navigate)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will take ownership of the &lt;strong&gt;Categories&lt;/strong&gt; squad. You will work alongside a dedicated engineering squad (Tech Lead, Senior Software Engineers), and collaborate closely with UX Researchers, Product Designers, Data Analysts, Sports Digital Merchandisers, and local Country E-Commerce teams).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Vision:&lt;/strong&gt; Empowering discovery through intelligent, scalable navigation. We build an intuitive, automated, and personalized browsing journey so every customer finds what they need, want, and desire faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive global conversion and incremental revenue by transforming fragmented local treeviews into a unified, high-performing Core Navigation across web and mobile platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Vision &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the product vision, strategy, and roadmap for the &lt;strong&gt;Categories &amp;amp; Core Navigation&lt;/strong&gt; ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and arbitrate key product streams across &lt;strong&gt;Core Navigation&lt;/strong&gt; (standardizing category trees globally) and &lt;strong&gt;SKU-Level Categorization Engines&lt;/strong&gt; (such as our streaming engine &lt;em&gt;Tesseract&lt;/em&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align stakeholders across central sports teams, global digital merchandising, and local country teams around shared treeview operating models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously identify user, SEO, and market opportunities through data analysis, user testing, and card-sorting studies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a continuous and consistent A/B testing process to refine business convictions and identify top growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance global standardization with local market flexibility, ensuring smooth migration from local catalog treeviews to global &lt;strong&gt;Core Trees&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear decision-making frameworks and SLAs for global taxonomy, SEO content guidance, and category creation governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Technical Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead agile product delivery in close partnership with the Engineering Lead and squad members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize and mature the team’s backlog (epics, user stories) to support multi-level export feed pipelines, batch orchestration tooling, and taxonomy rules execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee key migration milestones for countries adopting the Core Navigation framework across desktop and mobile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track success metrics across navigation channels, including &lt;strong&gt;PDP Reach Rate, Revenue per Session, Menu Usage CTR&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Category-Level Conversion&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data analytics to streamline category performance, eliminating inactive categories and optimizing taxonomy filters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arbitrate and prioritize backlog based on data driven decision&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Mindset &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an ambassador for product excellence and taxonomy standards across Decathlon’s global network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a collaborative work environment based on trust, accountability, and user-centric decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROFILE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience as a Product Manager in a fast-paced B2C e-commerce, digital platform, or catalog/search ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of e-commerce navigation, catalog treeviews, taxonomy/metadata structures, or search &amp;amp; discovery platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to navigate complex, multi-stakeholder international organizations (aligning global tech teams, business merchandisers, and country leads).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Methodology:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastery of end-to-end product development—from discovery (UX research, data analysis, A/B testing) to delivery (backlog refinement, technical roadmapping, release planning).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Data-driven approach to prioritizing product features and measuring conversion and user experience impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in English and French (written and spoken), with excellent synthesis skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passion:&lt;/strong&gt; Curiosity for solving scalable architecture/data problems, user-centric design, and a strong passion for sports!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Remote Work:&lt;/strong&gt; 2 days of remote work per week (flexible).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Based at our Decathlon Technology office in Paris, France.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Choice of Equipment:&lt;/strong&gt; Work on your preferred device (Mac, Windows, Chromebook).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Career Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; High-impact role at the heart of Decathlon&#39;s global e-commerce engine, offering mentorship, certifications, and international growth paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Employee shareholding opportunities, along with monthly and quarterly performance bonuses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/junior-data-scientist-downstream-demand-forecast-value-chain/product-manager-ecommerce-categories-paris-paris-74966","tags":["Product Management"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris, Paris","created_at":1791651306},{"slug":"founding-sales-at-hodor-backed-by-hexa-paris-41608","company_name":"Hexa","title":"Founding Sales @Hodor (backed by Hexa)","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em">Hodor is the security gateway for AI agent governance — between your harnesses and your applications, making sure each agent has the right tools for the right job. Nothing more.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.hodor.ai/">https://www.hodor.ai/</a></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Create your territory. Cold call. Own your pipe end to end. This is the first sales hire at Hodor — no inbound, no SDR feeding you, no playbook to inherit. You decide who to attack, you pick up the phone, you close, and you write the motion the rest of the sales team will run on. Build like a founder.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Create your own territory — choose the segments, accounts and personas worth attacking, and defend the thesis.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Cold call, every day. Phone, email, LinkedIn, events — whatever gets the first real conversation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own your pipeline end to end: discovery, technical evaluation, security review, pricing, negotiation, close.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run POCs with security and platform teams, and turn pilots into signed contracts.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Write the playbook as you go — ICP, qualification, objection handling, pricing, and the collateral behind it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring the market back to the product: what enterprises ask for, what blocks a deal, what wins one.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Stand up the GTM stack — CRM discipline, sequences, forecasting — so the next hires inherit a system, not a mess.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Represent Hodor in the field: meetups, conferences, CISO and platform-leader circles.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hire and ramp the first AEs and SDRs once the motion is repeatable.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">What you bring</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Real closing experience in B2B SaaS — you've carried a quota and beaten it, and you can walk through the deals.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You cold call without flinching. Prospection is the job, not a chore you delegate.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfort selling a technical product to technical buyers — CISOs, CTOs, platform and security teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Founder mentality: no inbound, no playbook, no safety net — you'd rather build the machine than operate someone else's.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Enterprise deal instincts: multiple stakeholders, procurement, security questionnaires, legal.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent in French and English — we sell in France first, Europe next.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Nice to have</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You've sold cybersecurity, developer tools, or data infrastructure.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You were among the first ten at a startup and watched a GTM motion go from zero to repeatable.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with AI agents, MCP, or how large enterprises are actually deploying LLMs internally.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You build your own GTM tooling and automations (Clay, HubSpot, Apollo) rather than just using them.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Not for you if…</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You need inbound leads or an SDR to fill your calendar.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You want a defined territory, a mature playbook, and a comp plan that never moves.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You think cold calling is beneath you.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'd rather manage a team than close deals yourself for the first year.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You prefer fully-remote work (we work 3+ days a week from the office).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You don't thrive at the fast pace of early-stage startups.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Why join us</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A real problem to solve: AI agent security is the strategic question of the moment. It isn't one more feature — it's a defence against an existential risk for large enterprises.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You're not joining a sales org, you're founding one — and the playbook has your name on it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Momentum: pre-seed already raised (Hexa and others), seed planned within 6–12 months. You join a team that's accelerating.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Winners of the VivaTech Innovation of the Year award, and part of a top Station F programme.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work shoulder to shoulder with the founders, with a direct line to the roadmap you're selling.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">French and sovereign by design — based in Paris, French infrastructure, European values.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Interested ? Apply here: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.hodor.ai/careers/apply?role=founding-sales">https://www.hodor.ai/careers/apply?role=founding-sales</a></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/hexa/founding-sales-at-hodor-backed-by-hexa-paris-41608","tags":["Hexa"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris","created_at":1791650414},{"slug":"senior-projektleiter-hybrid-166091","company_name":"Assecor Group","title":"Senior Projektleiter (m/w/d)","description":"<br><strong>Deine Rolle bei uns</strong><p>Du übernimmst die übergreifende Steuerung großer Kundenaccounts mit mehreren parallelen IT- und Softwareentwicklungsprojekten. Dabei verantwortest du Termine, Budgets, Ressourcen, Qualität und Risiken und führst Projektmanager und Projektteams fachlich. <br>Dein Fokus liegt auf einer belastbaren, projektübergreifenden Steuerung. Du erkennst Risiken und Abhängigkeiten frühzeitig und greifst gezielt ein, wenn Projekte aus der Spur geraten. Als zentrale Schnittstelle zwischen Kunden, Projektteams und Delivery Management sorgst du dafür, dass komplexe Kundenaccounts erfolgreich gesteuert werden.</p><br><strong>Aufgaben</strong><p><ul><li>Du steuerst große Kundenaccounts mit mehreren parallelen IT- und Softwareentwicklungsprojekten und behältst Termine, Budgets, Qualität und Risiken im Gesamtblick. </li><li>Du steuerst und unterstützt die Projektteams innerhalb deines Accounts und förderst deren fachliche Weiterentwicklung im Rahmen der laufenden Projekte.</li><li>Du setzt ein wirksames Risikomanagement um und stellst sicher, dass Risiken, Abhängigkeiten und Eskalationen frühzeitig erkannt, bewertet und adressiert werden.</li><li>Du schaffst Transparenz durch Kennzahlen, Forecasts, Statusberichte und belastbare Entscheidungsgrundlagen. </li><li>Du steuerst die Kommunikation mit Kunden auf Managementebene und moderierst Lenkungsausschüsse sowie kritische Abstimmungen. </li><li>Du koordinierst Ressourcen und Kompetenzen projektübergreifend und setzt klare Prioritäten. </li><li>Du greifst bei gefährdeten Projekten gezielt ein, stabilisierst die Steuerung und übergibst die operative Verantwortung anschließend wieder an den zuständigen Projektmanager. </li><li>Du begleitest die Übergabe neuer Projekte aus dem Vertrieb in die Delivery und schärfst Scope, Erwartungen und Kalkulation. </li><li>Du entwickelst gemeinsam mit Delivery Excellence Projektmanagement-Standards, Methoden und Best Practices weiter. </li></ul></p><br><strong>Qualifikation</strong><p><ul><li>Du verfügst über mehrjährige Erfahrung in der Steuerung komplexer IT-Projekte, Programme oder größerer Kundenaccounts mit mehreren parallel laufenden Projekten.</li><li>Du bringst fundierte Erfahrung im Projektcontrolling sowie in der Budget- und Forecaststeuerung, im Risiko- und Eskalationsmanagement mit.</li><li>Du hast Erfahrung in der fachlichen Führung und Weiterentwicklung von Projektmanagern sowie interdisziplinären Teams.</li><li>Du bist erfahren in der Steuerung anspruchsvoller Kunden und im Umgang mit Management- und Entscheidungsebenen.</li><li>Du bist in der Lage, kritische Projektsituationen schnell zu erfassen, geeignete Maßnahmen einzuleiten und Projekte nachhaltig zu stabilisieren.</li><li>Du verfügst über ein solides Verständnis von Softwareentwicklungsprojekten, IT-Architekturen und modernen Entwicklungsprozessen.</li><li>Du denkst unternehmerisch und verstehst die wirtschaftlichen Zusammenhänge von IT-Projekten.</li><li>Du trittst souverän auf und überzeugst durch Kommunikations- und Moderationsstärke sowie eine hohe Entscheidungssicherheit.</li><li>Du verfügst über sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift auf mindestens C1-Niveau.</li></ul><strong>Womit du zusätzlich punktest</strong><br><ul><li>Du bringst Erfahrung aus dem IT-Beratungs-, Softwareentwicklungs- oder IT-Dienstleistungsumfeld mit.</li><li>Du hast Erfahrung im Umgang mit Jira, Azure DevOps, Confluence, Plane, Moco oder vergleichbaren Werkzeugen.</li><li>Du verfügst über Zertifizierungen wie IPMA, PMP, PRINCE2, Scrum oder vergleichbare Qualifikationen.</li><li>Du hast bereits kritische oder eskalierte IT-Projekte erfolgreich stabilisiert.</li><li>Du interessierst dich für aktuelle Entwicklungen im Bereich Künstliche Intelligenz und nutzt moderne KI-gestützte Werkzeuge, um Transparenz, Effizienz und Qualität im Projekt- und Programmmanagement weiter zu steigern.</li></ul></p><br><strong>Benefits</strong><p><ul style="border:0px solid;font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';margin:8px 0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 24px;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;color:rgb(31,31,31);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);"><li style="border:0px solid;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;list-style-type:disc;margin:0px;">Flexible Arbeitszeiten und die Möglichkeit remote zu arbeiten</li><li style="border:0px solid;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;list-style-type:disc;margin:0px;">Entwicklungsmöglichkeiten inkl. Übernahme von Weiterbildungskosten</li><li style="border:0px solid;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;list-style-type:disc;margin:0px;">Flache Hierarchien und kurze Entscheidungswege</li><li style="border:0px solid;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;list-style-type:disc;margin:0px;">Individuelle Entfaltung un