</div><br><strong>How We Build</strong><br><div>
<p>We build with AI tools, in earnest rather than as an experiment. Every engineer here has Claude Code, and it is part of how we write, review, and ship code day to day.</p>
<p>We are also designing something larger: an&nbsp;<strong>AI code and delivery factory</strong>&nbsp;— AI woven into the build and release chain itself, not just into the editor. That work is early and still being thought through rather than already solved. We expect it to become part of how we maintain the platform, and CVE remediation is one of the first places we think it fits: an automated path from advisory to assessment to a patched, tested, delivered build.</p>
