e offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><h1><strong>About the role</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're hiring a Direct Tax Lead to own our US income tax provision, compliance, and controls, reporting to the Head of Tax. ElevenLabs operates through its US entity and ~9 international entities and is growing fast, which means the provision, the compliance calendar, and the controls around them need a dedicated owner.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a hands-on ownership role. The provision and returns are prepared by external providers; you manage those engagements and are accountable for the output. You'll own the quarterly and annual ASC 740 provision (deferreds, valuation allowance, uncertain tax positions, rate rec, footnote disclosures), the US federal and state compliance calendar (returns, extensions, estimated payments), and the technical work underneath it: §174 capitalization, §382 and NOL tracking.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll also assist in designing, documenting, and operating controls, and write the memos that support our positions, working directly with our Big 4 advisors and external auditors alongside the Head of Tax.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deep ASC 740 expertise at a multinational — provision, deferreds, valuation allowance, uncertain tax positions, rate reconciliation, and footnote disclosure</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience owning a US federal and multistate compliance calendar (returns, extensions, estimates)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Working knowledge of US international provisions (NCTI/GILTI, Subpart F, FDDEI, §163(j)) and how they flow into the provision</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience managing Big 4 or equivalent providers and working directly with external auditors</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Has built or operated SOX controls over tax, or supported a first SOX implementation</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">CPA</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bonus: pre-IPO or first-10-K experience, §174/§41 computation, §382 studies, equity compensation tax (ISOs, NSOs, RSUs), OneSource Tax Provision or similar.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Growth Potential</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We believe in hiring the best talent in the world to make an impact in the right role at the right time. At ElevenLabs, strong performance creates opportunities for growth. Here are some of the career paths you can expect after excelling in this role:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and lead the direct tax team as we bring provision and compliance in-house</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Expand into other strategic initiatives such as M&amp;A, PE mitigation policy, corporate structuring.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Broaden into wider tax leadership as our footprint grows</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Location</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role is remote-first, so it can be executed from anywhere on the east coast, New York preferred.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/elevenlabs/remote-direct-tax-lead-343269","tags":["Finance"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Remote","created_at":1791574802},{"slug":"remote-enterprise-sales-lead-financial-services-491354","company_name":"ElevenLabs","title":"Enterprise Sales Lead- Financial Services","description":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we i