ht:1.5em">Being part of Alan's insurance community is a great opportunity to have a significant impact on people's health and wellbeing in our multiple countries of operation. </p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We are at the heart of Alan’s mission</strong>, bringing to the team our technical leadership and expertise on healthcare and death &amp; disability insurance. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We work hand in hand with our data scientists, designers, engineers and product managers to build the most differentiating products and <strong>provide a delightful experience at a fair price.</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We build and manage offers</strong> for large companies and public institutions with our sales and account management teams. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We make sure our portfolio is closely monitored</strong> and risks are effectively managed. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We also manage our capital, steer our reinsurance strategy</strong> and maintain a trusting relationship with our insurance regulators.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2> ⭐️ Your role ⭐️ ️</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">As Alan’s <strong>Risk Expert</strong>, you will be in charge of providing Alan with automated and scalable risk assessment tools:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Risk modeling</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will be in charge of strengthening and automating the building our <strong>Solvency 2 balance sheet</strong> and <strong>capital requirements</strong> projections, covering both health, death and disability business lines</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will <strong>model new risks </strong>when they arise (new insurance products,  branches, international, investment etc.)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will challenge our <strong>risk appetite</strong>, propose new relevant <strong>risk metrics</strong> and <strong>build tools</strong> to monitor them</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will support the board meetings preparation and <strong>communication with investors</strong> regarding capital evolution and market risks</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Regulatory</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will scale and automate the production of our regulatory <strong>quantitative reporting</strong> and contribute to our narrative (SFCR, RSR) and ORSA reports</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will support our <strong>discussions with supervisors</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will assist the assessment of <strong>international</strong> opportunities and help prepare the opening of new countries</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Capital management</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will make proposals to improve our <strong>capital management </strong>in the 4 countries Alan is present</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will manage our reinsurance strategy, to find an optimum between solvency and profitability, negotiating with reinsurance partners, and analyze reinsurance reporting</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Team Growth</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will create processes and <strong>resources</strong> to strengthen the team’s ability to understand our risk and capital constraints</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will support the identification and <strong>hiring</strong> of new talents for the Insurance and Risk teams.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>⭐️ Is it you we’re looking for? ⭐️</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You would thrive in this role if you:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5e