ost and quality before launch</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design, monitor and analyse experiments on millions of sessions, and ship, iterate or kill on the result</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run deep analyses and user research yourself, and be the voice of the user in every decision</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set the strategy and roadmap for your area from user feedback, data and business goals, with a commercial case, cost and outcome metrics for every bet</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Align engineering, design, SEO, growth, marketing and other product teams on what ships and why</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead without authority: manage up with clear recommendations, settle ownership with peer teams, and present plans and results to leadership and the whole company</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Raise the bar around you: help your team own product decisions, give and take honest feedback, coach others, and step outside the PM role when it moves the needle</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About you</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">6+ years in product management</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on A/B testing experience on a product with real traffic</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">AI in your daily work: workflows, analysis, prototyping, research. You know where it goes wrong and you check it</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience defining need &amp; quality for an AI feature, or a clear view of how you would do it</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable talking with engineers about trade-offs, speed, errors and estimations</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Dynamic and hands-on: you make quick decisions based on real data</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable with ambiguity: you find the problem worth solving when nobody has named it yet</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Curious and rigorous: you dig into the data yourself until the answer holds</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You run user research yourself, and bring what you learn into decisions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Commercially minded: you know what a feature is worth before you build it</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A clear communicator who aligns people without needing authority, with excellent written and spoken English</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice to have</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Document or file-processing products</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A utility business with a strong free tier</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with high-volume consumer tools</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with SEO, SEM or AI search as acquisition channels</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>Important note: this is a hybrid role based in our Zurich office. You either already live in the Zurich area or are willing to relocate.</strong></em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Join Smallpdf - Where innovation meets impact!</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Becoming part of our team means more than just taking a job - it’s joining a dynamic, collaborative environment where your voice matters, your growth is championed, and your work truly makes a difference.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Here, we don’t just talk about a growth mindset - we live it. You’ll thrive in a culture that balances professional ambition with personal well-being, where flexibility, creativity, and purpose come together. Whether you're shaping the future through groundbreaking projects or leveling up your skills, your journey here will be one of impact, innovation, and continuous learning. This reflects in our company <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://smallpdf.com/careers#:~:text=in%20the