em up to scale successfully in production</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Serve as a trusted advisor, educating clients on generative AI and voice, and help shape the Financial Services playbook: ICP, messaging, and references</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Requirements</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">7+ years of quota-carrying enterprise sales experience in SaaS or technology, ideally with exposure to AI, generative AI, LLM-based products, or API-driven platforms</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience selling to financial services institutions (banks, insurers, lenders, fintech and payments) is a strong plus</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven success closing seven-figure deals and managing complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience selling to both technical buyers (product and engineering) and business buyers (CX, operations, digital), and to risk and compliance gatekeepers, translating complex technology into business value</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Adept at deeply understanding a customer's business and unique requirements for success, and translating ElevenLabs' capabilities into solutions that deliver against their needs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proficient in enterprise procurement, security review, and legal processes, including regulated-industry vendor risk, model risk, and data protection reviews, with the ability to work autonomously and effectively as a cross-functional partner</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong executive presence, the ability to build relationships at the C-suite and board level, and willingness to travel frequently and proactively for onsite client visits and conferences</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfort in an early-stage, high-growth environment, where ambiguity is the norm and the state of play changes rapidly</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1