ations break through the automation ceiling by orchestrating AI agents, people, and systems at scale.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're witnessing a pivotal moment: enterprises are deploying AI agents faster than ever, but they're struggling to coordinate them safely and achieve end-to-end outcomes. That's where Camunda comes in. You'll work with curious, collaborative, and highly motivated people who believe in doing great work without ego. This is a role where your contributions will have a visible impact—not only on your customers' success, but on how they operationalize AI across their entire organization.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What You Will Do</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive the full sales cycle—from initial outreach to negotiation and close—with prospects in the corporate segment (typically organizations with under $1B in revenue).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner closely with marketing, partner teams, sales development, and customer success to create compelling customer journeys that turn interest into adoption.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Position Camunda's unique approach to agentic orchestration- building strong relationships with technical leaders, line-of-business executives, and decision-makers through in-person and virtual settings.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Accurately forecast, generate / manage pipeline, and consistently meet or exceed quota goals with integrity.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Become a trusted advisor by deeply understanding each prospect's automation goals, the gaps they face with current tools, and how Camunda helps scale agentic orchestration across their entire business.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with colleagues across the business to share learnings, improve our sales playbook, and strengthen how we talk about agentic orchestration in the market.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><