<li>Practical experience handling checkpoints, verification, and account recovery.</li>
<li>Experience working with proxies, anti-detect or browser-profile solutions, email accounts, phone numbers, and 2FA.</li>
<li>Experience managing suppliers or other account-related resources.</li>
